    "slug": "storypole-add-kind-silently-falls-back-to-feature-for-an-unknown-value-b8f889",
    "title": "storypole add --kind silently falls back to Feature for an unknown value",
    "description": "storypole add --kind perf created a Feature, and defer --kind docs did the same, so a typo in a kind is accepted instead of rejected. Two consequences: ticket kind is unreliable for filtering, and the mistake is invisible because the command succeeds. Should validate against the TaskKind vocabulary and exit non-zero with the allowed values. Also fix the flag-naming split while in there: add and defer take --files/--criteria/--symbols while update takes --file/--criterion/--symbol, which cost three failed invocations during the GB-182 and GB-189 close-outs.",
    "kind": "bug",
    "status": "verified",
